==Trivia==
This card is almost identical to {{TCG ID|Journey Together|Lotad|35}} from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]'s {{TCG|Journey Together}} expansion, except for the {{TCG|Weakness}} modifier.
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Deoxys|Lotad|35}} from the {{TCG|EX Deoxys}} expansion.
*{{m|Water Gun}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Lotad}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

